@startuml UC-12
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-12.md
title UC-12: Set Default Address
footer Feature PROF-05 | Business rules: BR-08, BR-09
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Customer" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "ProfileController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "ProfileService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

U -> MVC : Click "Set as default" on an address
MVC -> API : PUT /api/profile/addresses/{id}/default
API -> SVC : SetDefaultAddressAsync(currentUserId, id)
SVC -> DB : Find address WHERE Id = id AND UserId = current user (BR-08)
alt not found or owned by another user
  SVC --> API : NotFound
  API --> MVC : 404 Not Found
  MVC --> U : Show "Address not found"
else found
  group transaction (BR-09)
    SVC -> DB : Set IsDefault = 0 on current default\nSaveChangesAsync
    SVC -> DB : Set IsDefault = 1 on selected address\nSaveChangesAsync
    SVC -> DB : COMMIT
  end
  note right of SVC : Two separate saves so the filtered unique\nindex UX_UserAddresses_Default is never violated
  SVC --> API : OK
  API --> MVC : 204 No Content
  MVC --> U : Show new default first
end

@enduml
